563}, {"text": "The prescribed poems are:", "x0": 0.1813186813186813, "y0": 0.5718725718725719, "x1": 0.3923076923076923, "y1": 0.585081585081585}, {"text": "Wild Grapes", "x0": 0.1824175824175824, "y0": 0.5998445998445998, "x1": 0.2835164835164835, "y1": 0.6130536130536131}, {"text": "Gulliver", "x0": 0.1824175824175824, "y0": 0.6184926184926185, "x1": 0.24835164835164836, "y1": 0.6285936285936286}, {"text": "Out of Time", "x0": 0.1824175824175824, "y0": 0.6371406371406372, "x1": 0.2802197802197802, "y1": 0.6472416472416472}, {"text": "Vesper-Song of the Reverend Samuel Marsden", "x0": 0.1824175824175824, "y0": 0.6557886557886557, "x1": 0.5604395604395604, "y1": 0.668997668997669}, {"text": "William Street", "x0": 0.1824175824175824, "y0": 0.6744366744366744, "x1": 0.2989010989010989, "y1": 0.6845376845376845}, {"text": "Beach Burial", "x0": 0.1824175824175824, "y0": 0.6930846930846931, "x1": 0.2857142857142857, "y1": 0.7031857031857032}, {"text": "+ Drama", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.7482517482517482, "x1": 0.19230769230769232, "y1": 0.7575757575757576}, {"text": "\u2014 Jane Harrison, Rainbow's End, from Vivienne Cleven et al., Contemporary Indigenous", "x0": 0.12527472527472527, "y0": 0.7746697746697747, "x1": 0.8373626373626374, "y1": 0.7878787878787878}, {"text": "Plays", "x0": 0.12087912087912088, "y0": 0.7925407925407926, "x1": 0.16483516483516483, "y1": 0.8057498057498057}, {"text": "\u2014 Arthur Miller, The Crucible", "x0": 0.12087912087912088, "y0": 0.8197358197358198, "x1": 0.36043956043956044, "y1": 0.8321678321678322}], [{"text": "+ Shakespearean Drama", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.08935508935508936, "x1": 0.3274725274725275, "y1": 0.10178710178710179}, {"text": "\u2014 William Shakespeare, The Merchant of Venice", "x0": 0.12087912087912088, "y0": 0.11577311577311578, "x1": 0.512087912087912, "y1": 0.128982128982129}, {"text": "+ Nonfiction", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.17094017094017094, "x1": 0.2230769230769231, "y1": 0.18026418026418026}, {"text": "\u2014Tim Winton, The Boy Behind the Curtain", "x0": 0.12087912087912088, "y0": 0.19735819735819735, "x1": 0.4703296703296703, "y1": 0.21056721056721056}, {"text": "\u00a9 Havoc: A Life in Accidents", "x0": 0.15164835164835164, "y0": 0.22533022533022534, "x1": 0.4032967032967033, "y1": 0.23543123543123542}, {"text": "Betsy", "x0": 0.1824175824175824, "y0": 0.24475524475524477, "x1": 0.22637362637362637, "y1": 0.2571872571872572}, {"text": "\u00a9 Twice on Sundays", "x0": 0.15164835164835164, "y0": 0.26262626262626265, "x1": 0.32967032967032966, "y1": 0.27583527583527584}, {"text": "\u00a9 The Wait and the Flow", "x0": 0.15164835164835164, "y0": 0.28205128205128205, "x1": 0.3659340659340659, "y1": 0.29215229215229216}, {"text": "* In the Shadow of the Hospital", "x0": 0.15164835164835164, "y0": 0.3006993006993007, "x1": 0.4208791208791209, "y1": 0.3139083139083139}, {"text": "\u00a9 The Demon Shark", "x0": 0.15164835164835164, "y0": 0.31934731934731936, "x1": 0.32857142857142857, "y1": 0.32944832944832947}, {"text": "\u00a9 Barefoot in the Temple of Art", "x0": 0.15164835164835164, "y0": 0.337995337995338, "x1": 0.421978021978022, "y1": 0.35120435120435123}, {"text": "\u2014Malala Yousafzai and Christina Lamb, J am Malala", "x0": 0.12087912087912088, "y0": 0.3822843822843823, "x1": 0.5527472527472528, "y1": 0.3947163947163947}, {"text": "+ Film", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.43745143745143744, "x1": 0.17252747252747253, "y1": 0.4467754467754468}, {"text": "\u2014 Stephen Daldry, Billy Elliot", "x0": 0.12527472527472527, "y0": 0.46386946386946387, "x1": 0.3648351648351648, "y1": 0.47707847707847706}, {"text": "+ Media", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.519036519036519, "x1": 0.18681318681318682, "y1": 0.5283605283605284}, {"text": "\u2014 Ivan O'Mahoney", "x0": 0.12087912087912088, "y0": 0.5454545454545454, "x1": 0.27362637362637365, "y1": 0.5586635586635587}, {"text": "* Go Back to Where You Came From", "x0": 0.15164835164835164, "y0": 0.5742035742035742, "x1": 0.46593406593406594, "y1": 0.5843045843045843}, {"text": "~ Series 1: Episodes 1, 2 and 3", "x0": 0.1813186813186813, "y0": 0.6006216006216006, "x1": 0.42637362637362636, "y1": 0.6138306138306139}, {"text": "and", "x0": 0.1824175824175824, "y0": 0.6285936285936286, "x1": 0.2098901098901099, "y1": 0.6386946386946387}, {"text": "\u00a9 The Response", "x0": 0.15164835164835164, "y0": 0.6565656565656566, "x1": 0.2923076923076923, "y1": 0.6697746697746698}, {"text": "\u2014 Lucy Walker, Waste Land", "x0": 0.1813186813186813, "y0": 0.6837606837606838, "x1": 0.4087912087912088, "y1": 0.696969696969697}, {"text": "10", "x0": 0.49230769230769234, "y0": 0.9292929292929293, "x1": 0.5087912087912088, "y1": 0.9378399378399378}], [{"text": "STUDENT NUMBER", "x0": 0.6054945054945055, "y0": 0.11965811965811966, "x1": 0.8175824175824176, "y1": 0.13131313131313133}, {"text": "ABBOTSLEIGH", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.2400932400932401, "x1": 0.2923076923076923, "y1": 0.2517482517482518}, {"text": "2021 HSC TRIAL EXAMINATION", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.3006993006993007, "x1": 0.5340659340659341, "y1": 0.3139083139083139}, {"text": "English Advanced", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.3356643356643357, "x1": 0.4054945054945055, "y1": 0.358974358974359}, {"text": "Paper 1 \u2014 Texts and Human Experiences", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.40714840714840717, "x1": 0.7043956043956044, "y1": 0.4289044289044289}, {"text": "STIMULUS BOOKLET", "x0": 0.12307692307692308, "y0": 0.4763014763014763, "x1": 0.4714285714285714, "y1": 0.4933954933954934}, {"text": "Section I", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.5135975135975136, "x1": 0.21978021978021978, "y1": 0.5268065268065268}, {"text": "Text One \u2014 Narrative comic extrac", "x0": 0.1824175824175824, "y0": 0.5796425796425796, "x1": 0.46483516483516485, "y1": 0.5897435897435898}, {"text": "Text Two \u2014 Poem", "x0": 0.1824175824175824, "y0": 0.5990675990675991, "x1": 0.32857142857142857, "y1": 0.6083916083916084}, {"text": "Text Three \u2014 Prose fiction e:", "x0": 0.1824175824175824, "y0": 0.616938616938617, "x1": 0.41318681318681316, "y1": 0.627039627039627}, {"text": "Text Four \u2014 Discursive p.5", "x0": 0.1824175824175824, "y0": 0.6355866355866356, "x1": 0.8142857142857143, "y1": 0.6487956487956488}], [{"text": "Text 1 \u2014 Narrative comic extract", "x0": 0.12087912087912088, "y0": 0.08857808857808858, "x1": 0.4, "y1": 0.09945609945609946}, {"text": "GAVIN AUNG THAN", "x0": 0.6901098901098901, "y0": 0.749028749028749, "x1": 0.878021978021978, "y1": 0.7599067599067599}, {"text": "\u2018Make Good Art\u2019 by Neil Gaiman.", "x0": 0.6054945054945055, "y0": 0.7661227661227661, "x1": 0.878021978021978, "y1": 0.7793317793317793}, {"text": "from Zen Pencils", "x0": 0.7406593406593407, "y0": 0.7839937839937839, "x1": 0.878021978021978, "y1": 0.7948717948717948}], [{"text": "Text Two \u2014 Poem", "x0": 0.12087912087912088, "y0": 0.08935508935508936, "x1": 0.2703296703296703, "y1": 0.09867909867909867}, {"text": "from \u2018The Great Lover\u2019", "x0": 0.11758241758241758, "y0": 0.12432012432012432, "x1": 0.3241758241758242, "y1": 0.13752913752913754}, {"text": "These I have loved:", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.1592851592851593, "x1": 0.27692307692307694, "y1": 0.16938616938616938}, {"text": "White plates and cups, clean-gleaming,", "x0": 0.27582417582417584, "y0": 0.17560217560217561, "x1": 0.5901098901098901, "y1": 0.1888111888111888}, {"text": "Ringed with blue lines; and feathery, faery dust;", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.1919191919191919, "x1": 0.5076923076923077, "y1": 0.20512820512820512}, {"text": "Wet roofs, beneath the lamp-light; the strong crust", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.20823620823620823, "x1": 0.5263736263736264, "y1": 0.22144522144522144}, {"text": "Of friendly bread; and many-tasting food:", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.22455322455322455, "x1": 0.45714285714285713, "y1": 0.23776223776223776}, {"text": "Rainbows; and the blue bitter smoke of wood;", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.24087024087024086, "x1": 0.4912087912087912, "y1": 0.2533022533022533}, {"text": "And radiant raindrops couching in cool flowers;", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.2571872571872572, "x1": 0.5065934065934066, "y1": 0.2703962703962704}, {"text": "And flowers themselves, that sway through sunny hours,", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.2742812742812743, "x1": 0.5769230769230769, "y1": 0.2874902874902875}, {"text": "Dreaming of moths that drink them under the moon;", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.2905982905982906, "x1": 0.5417582417582417, "y1": 0.3038073038073038}, {"text": "Then, the cool kindliness of sheets, that soon", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.30691530691530694, "x1": 0.4824175824175824, "y1": 0.31934731934731936}, {"text": "Smooth away trouble; and the rough male kiss", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.32323232323232326, "x1": 0.4945054945054945, "y1": 0.33644133644133645}, {"text": "Of blankets; grainy wood; live hair that is", "x0": 0.11758241758241758, "y0": 0.3317793317793318, "x1": 0.45604395604395603, "y1": 0.35664335664335667}, {"text": "Shining and free; blue-massing clouds; the keen", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.35586635586635584, "x1": 0.5076923076923077, "y1": 0.3690753690753691}, {"text": "Unpassioned beauty of a great machine;", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.3644133644133644, "x1": 0.44175824175824174, "y1": 0.3885003885003885}, {"text": "The benison of hot water; furs to touch;", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.38073038073038074, "x1": 0.43956043956043955, "y1": 0.40404040404040403}, {"text": "The good smell of old clothes; and other such\u2014", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.4017094017094017, "x1": 0.5087912087912088, "y1": 0.4219114219114219}, {"text": "The comfortable smell of friendly fingers,", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.4133644133644134, "x1": 0.4582417582417582, "y1": 0.43745143745143744}, {"text": "Hair's fragrance, and the musty reek that lingers", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.43745143745143744, "x1": 0.5065934065934066, "y1": 0.4506604506604507}, {"text": "O dear my loves, O faithless, once again", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.48717948717948717, "x1": 0.4461538461538462, "y1": 0.5003885003885004}, {"text": "This one last gift I give: that after men", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.5034965034965035, "x1": 0.42967032967032964, "y1": 0.5167055167055167}, {"text": "Shall know, and later lovers, far-removed,", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.5198135198135199, "x1": 0.4604395604395604, "y1": 0.5322455322455323}, {"text": "Praise you, 'Alll these were lovely\u2019; say, 'He loved.\u2019", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.5361305361305362, "x1": 0.5263736263736264, "y1": 0.5493395493395493}, {"text": "RUPERT BROOKE", "x0": 0.7142857142857143, "y0": 0.6503496503496503, "x1": 0.878021978021978, "y1": 0.6604506604506605}], [{"text": "Text Three \u2014 Prose fiction extract", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.08935508935508936, "x1": 0.4087912087912088, "y1": 0.09867909867909867}, {"text": "from The Blackboard Jungle", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.1250971250971251, "x1": 0.3648351648351648, "y1": 0.13752913752913754}, {"text": "(The scene takes place in New York, 1955)", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.1414141414141414, "x1": 0.46263736263736266, "y1": 0.15462315462315462}, {"text": "The building presented a not unpleasant architectural scheme, the banks of wide windows", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.17715617715617715, "x1": 0.843956043956044, "y1": 0.19036519036519037}, {"text": "reflecting golden sunlight, the browned weathered brick fagade, the ivy clinging to the brick", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.19502719502719504, "x1": 0.8626373626373627, "y1": 0.20823620823620823}, {"text": "and framing the windows. His eyes passed over the turrets on each corner of the building,", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.20357420357420358, "x1": 0.8417582417582418, "y1": 0.22999222999222999}, {"text": "green-tiled in the sunlight. It was a nice-looking building, he thought.", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.22999222999222999, "x1": 0.6791208791208792, "y1": 0.2432012432012432}, {"text": "He walked through the cyclone fence and into the empty yard stretching before him in", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.26573426573426573, "x1": 0.8153846153846154, "y1": 0.2789432789432789}, {"text": "endless concrete monotony. It was still hot for September, and the sun glared off the concrete", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.27505827505827507, "x1": 0.8725274725274725, "y1": 0.29914529914529914}, {"text": "except where the building cast a turreted black shadow near the entrance steps. He was a little", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.3006993006993007, "x1": 0.8758241758241758, "y1": 0.3139083139083139}, {"text": "nervous, but he knew that would pass once the interview started. He was always nervous", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.3185703185703186, "x1": 0.8351648351648352, "y1": 0.3317793317793318}, {"text": "before an interview. He would feel all bottled up until the first few words were spoken. Then", "x0": 0.12087912087912088, "y0": 0.33644133644133645, "x1": 0.8692307692307693, "y1": 0.34965034965034963}, {"text": "the cork would be drawn, and all the nervousness would spill out, leaving only confidence", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.35353535353535354, "x1": 0.8472527472527472, "y1": 0.3667443667443667}, {"text": "that always lay just beneath the bottled surface of the nervousness.", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.3714063714063714, "x1": 0.656043956043956, "y1": 0.38461538461538464}, {"text": "He paused on the shadowed steps, partly to reassure himself of his confidence, and partly to", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.3986013986013986, "x1": 0.8604395604395605, "y1": 0.425019425019425}, {"text": "look up at the chiselled letters in the triangular arch over the doorway.", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.42424242424242425, "x1": 0.6846153846153846, "y1": 0.43745143745143744}, {"text": "NORTH MANUAL TRADES HIGH SCHOOL", "x0": 0.3065934065934066, "y0": 0.45998445998445997, "x1": 0.6923076923076923, "y1": 0.4700854700854701}, {"text": "Leave us gird our loins, he thought.", "x0": 0.12087912087912088, "y0": 0.494949494949495, "x1": 0.4065934065934066, "y1": 0.5081585081585082}, {"text": "He sucked in a deep breath, the way a man on a diving board will just before taking the", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.5306915306915307, "x1": 0.823076923076923, "y1": 0.5439005439005439}, {"text": "plunge, and he started up the steps. He pulled open the wooden door, surprised to find marble", "x0": 0.12087912087912088, "y0": 0.5477855477855478, "x1": 0.8736263736263736, "y1": 0.560994560994561}, {"text": "steps behind it. He started up the marble steps and saw the sign GENERAL OFFICE.", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.5656565656565656, "x1": 0.8065934065934066, "y1": 0.5788655788655789}, {"text": "Beneath the sign, in sprawling crayon, someone had scribbled the timeless epithet, and an", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.5835275835275835, "x1": 0.8428571428571429, "y1": 0.5967365967365967}, {"text": "industrious summer custodian had succeeded in partially scrubbing away every letter but the", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.5928515928515928, "x1": 0.865934065934066, "y1": 0.6192696192696193}, {"text": "bold, black F of the first word. He smiled and followed the arrow beneath the sign into a", "x0": 0.12087912087912088, "y0": 0.6107226107226107, "x1": 0.8340659340659341, "y1": 0.6371406371406372}, {"text": "cool, dim corridor. There was another sign with another arrow in the corridor, and he", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.6363636363636364, "x1": 0.8054945054945055, "y1": 0.6495726495726496}, {"text": "followed dutifully, The halls were freshly painted and spotlessly clean. He admired this with", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.6542346542346542, "x1": 0.865934065934066, "y1": 0.6674436674436675}, {"text": "an air of proprietorship, almost as if he had already won the job. A clean school is a good", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.6721056721056721, "x1": 0.8406593406593407, "y1": 0.6853146853146853}, {"text": "school, he mused, and then he wondered in which education class he\u2019d picked that up.", "x0": 0.12087912087912088, "y0": 0.6899766899766899, "x1": 0.8142857142857143, "y1": 0.7031857031857032}, {"text": "He made a sharp right-angle turn at the end of the corridor, following the instructions of", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.7249417249417249, "x1": 0.832967032967033, "y1": 0.7381507381507382}, {"text": "another sign, and then walked rapidly to an open doorway through which sunlight streamed.", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.7428127428127428, "x1": 0.8615384615384616, "y1": 0.756021756021756}, {"text": "A sign to the right of the doorway read: GENERAL OFFICE. They believe in signs here, by", "x0": 0.12087912087912088, "y0": 0.7606837606837606, "x1": 0.8648351648351649, "y1": 0.7738927738927739}, {"text": "God, he thought. He expected to step into the room and find a desk with a sign reading,", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.7777777777777778, "x1": 0.823076923076923, "y1": 0.790986790986791}, {"text": "DESK, and a chair with another sign reading CHAIR. Mr Stanley would undoubtedly wear a", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.7956487956487956, "x1": 0.8692307692307693, "y1": 0.8088578088578089}, {"text": "cardboard placard strung around his neck, and the lettering on it would say MR STANLEY.", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.8135198135198135, "x1": 0.8604395604395605, "y1": 0.8267288267288267}, {"text": "He stood in the doorway, sighed impatiently, and stepped into the room.", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.8313908313908314, "x1": 0.701098901098901, "y1": 0.8445998445998446}, {"text": "EVAN HUNTER", "x0": 0.7373626373626374, "y0": 0.885003885003885, "x1": 0.878021978021978, "y1": 0.8943278943278943}], [{"text": "Text Four \u2014 Discursive essay", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.08935508935508936, "x1": 0.3659340659340659, "y1": 0.10178710178710179}, {"text": "Some Furniture", "x0": 0.12087912087912088, "y0": 0.1250971250971251, "x1": 0.2549450549450549, "y1": 0.13442113442113443}, {"text": "At the turn of the millennium I came home from Sydney with my tail between my legs.", "x0": 0.12087912087912088, "y0": 0.15151515151515152, "x1": 0.823076923076923, "y1": 0.17560217560217561}, {"text": "Single again.", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.17715617715617715, "x1": 0.22417582417582418, "y1": 0.19036519036519037}, {"text": "Tenants were still living in my Fitzroy house, and the one I rented for myself in Ascot Vale", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.19502719502719504, "x1": 0.856043956043956, "y1": 0.20823620823620823}, {"text": "was too narrow for the table Id had trucked down the Hume. I offered it to my niece. She", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.20901320901320902, "x1": 0.843956043956044, "y1": 0.22921522921522922}, {"text": "turned up with a bloke in a ute and away they went. I stood in the bare room.", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.22999222999222999, "x1": 0.7395604395604396, "y1": 0.2432012432012432}, {"text": "What can happen at the kitchen table when you haven\u2019t even got one?", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.26573426573426573, "x1": 0.6835164835164835, "y1": 0.2789432789432789}, {"text": "\u2018A woman on her own can easily get into the habit of standing at the open fridge door and", "x0": 0.12087912087912088, "y0": 0.29215229215229216, "x1": 0.8384615384615385, "y1": 0.3185703185703186}, {"text": "dining on a cold boiled potato. I was determined to be elegant in my solitude. But for lack of", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.3185703185703186, "x1": 0.8692307692307693, "y1": 0.3317793317793318}, {"text": "a table I had to eat off my knee, on the couch. The available space in the kitchen would take", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.33644133644133645, "x1": 0.8615384615384616, "y1": 0.34965034965034963}, {"text": "only a round table, and every round one I saw, in the crap shops I drifted through at", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.35353535353535354, "x1": 0.7934065934065934, "y1": 0.3667443667443667}, {"text": "Highpoint, had a hole drilled in the centre for an umbrella.", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.3714063714063714, "x1": 0.5901098901098901, "y1": 0.38461538461538464}, {"text": "It chanced that a schoolfriend of my daughter\u2019s was married to a woodworker. He came over,", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.40714840714840717, "x1": 0.8736263736263736, "y1": 0.42035742035742035}, {"text": "measured the spot, and returned in a couple of weeks with a perfect little creation in pale", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.42424242424242425, "x1": 0.8351648351648352, "y1": 0.43745143745143744}, {"text": "timber. It was so beautiful and so expensive that in my demoralised state I felt unworthy to sit", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.4421134421134421, "x1": 0.8769230769230769, "y1": 0.4553224553224553}, {"text": "at it, But I forced myself. I learnt to eat dainty salads off it, to nibble at fillets of fish steamed", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.45143745143745145, "x1": 0.8692307692307693, "y1": 0.47785547785547783}, {"text": "in ginger. This would be my single life.", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.47785547785547783, "x1": 0.43736263736263736, "y1": 0.49106449106449107}, {"text": "\u2018A year later I took back my old house from the tenants. The kitchen was a large room. The", "x0": 0.12087912087912088, "y0": 0.5128205128205128, "x1": 0.8505494505494505, "y1": 0.526029526029526}, {"text": "little round table floated on its expanse of floor like an autumn leaf on a lake. How could", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.5221445221445221, "x1": 0.8362637362637363, "y1": 0.5485625485625486}, {"text": "something so lovely look so silly, so out of place? I rolled it into one of the bedrooms and", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.5477855477855478, "x1": 0.843956043956044, "y1": 0.560994560994561}, {"text": "drove down to one of the fashionable recycled timber shops on Johnston Street. There I found", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.5571095571095571, "x1": 0.8769230769230769, "y1": 0.5835275835275835}, {"text": "a rectangular dining table of a suitable size. Until I bought my tiny round one, now", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.574980574980575, "x1": 0.7879120879120879, "y1": 0.6013986013986014}, {"text": "superseded, I wouldn\u2019t have paid four figures for a table in a fit. But the sign said it was made", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.6013986013986014, "x1": 0.8769230769230769, "y1": 0.6146076146076146}, {"text": "of jarrah that had been salvaged from a demolished warehouse. Its dimensions were pleasing.", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.6192696192696193, "x1": 0.8714285714285714, "y1": 0.6324786324786325}, {"text": "It had slightly tapered legs and a glossy top, on which I could imagine setting out white", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.6363636363636364, "x1": 0.8241758241758241, "y1": 0.6495726495726496}, {"text": "crockery, cloth napkins, perhaps a vase of flowers if anything pretty ever blossomed again in", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.6456876456876457, "x1": 0.8692307692307693, "y1": 0.6721056721056721}, {"text": "my garden, For a moment I was puzzled by certain dark nail punctures that randomly pitted", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.6721056721056721, "x1": 0.8582417582417582, "y1": 0.6853146853146853}, {"text": "its surface. All the furniture in the shop seemed to have them. Was this how recycled timber", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.6899766899766899, "x1": 0.8626373626373627, "y1": 0.7031857031857032}, {"text": "was supposed to look?", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.7070707070707071, "x1": 0.3021978021978022, "y1": 0.7202797202797203}, {"text": "It looked all right in the kitchen. Its top gave warm, dark glow. One day, when I trudged", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.7428127428127428, "x1": 0.8736263736263736, "y1": 0.756021756021756}, {"text": "in from work and dumped my red backpack on it, the two colours united in a fiery moment", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.7606837606837606, "x1": 0.8527472527472527, "y1": 0.7738927738927739}, {"text": "that made my mouth water.", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.7777777777777778, "x1": 0.34065934065934067, "y1": 0.790986790986791}, {"text": "Ina junk shop I found a shabby but surprisingly comfortable old sofa in gold brocade that", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.8135198135198135, "x1": 0.843956043956044, "y1": 0.8267288267288267}, {"text": "was bleached almost to silver. When it was delivered, I saw only its dated gentility; but then I", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.8313908313908314, "x1": 0.8747252747252747, "y1": 0.8445998445998446}, {"text": "tossed an equally ancient pink silk cushion on to it, and the pink and the faded gold sang to", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.8484848484848485, "x1": 0.8538461538461538, "y1": 0.8616938616938616}, {"text": "each other in quiet, tired voices. I saw that, living alone, one must play out one\u2019s domestic", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.8663558663558664, "x1": 0.8472527472527472, "y1": 0.8795648795648796}, {"text": "dramas through inanimate objects. Suddenly this did not seem so terrible,", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.8842268842268842, "x1": 0.710989010989011, "y1": 0.8974358974358975}], [{"text": "But the man who had made me the little round table called in one afternoon. He stopped at", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.08857808857808858, "x1": 0.8494505494505494, "y1": 0.10178710178710179}, {"text": "the kitchen door and contemplated the recycled jarrah table without expression. The he", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.10644910644910645, "x1": 0.8208791208791208, "y1": 0.11965811965811966}, {"text": "clicked his tongue and said, in a reproachful tone, \u2018Oh, Helen.\u201d", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.12432012432012432, "x1": 0.6263736263736264, "y1": 0.13752913752913754}, {"text": "I supposed it was the nail holes. He refrained from a detailed critique and I brazened it out.", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.1592851592851593, "x1": 0.8516483516483516, "y1": 0.17249417249417248}, {"text": "he left I got down on my haunches and had a look at the table\u2019s underside. I couldn\u2019t", "x0": 0.16923076923076924, "y0": 0.17715617715617715, "x1": 0.8505494505494505, "y1": 0.19036519036519037}, {"text": "believe what I saw. The thing was cobbled together in the most shamelessly bodgie way.", "x0": 0.12087912087912088, "y0": 0.19502719502719504, "x1": 0.8340659340659341, "y1": 0.20823620823620823}, {"text": "Random offeuts of raw pine, still sprouting ragged splinters, had been crudely jammed into", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.21212121212121213, "x1": 0.8549450549450549, "y1": 0.22533022533022534}, {"text": "its corners and stapled to brace it. No attempt had been made to hide the gross construction.", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.22999222999222999, "x1": 0.8582417582417582, "y1": 0.2432012432012432}, {"text": "A friend, whose house was notable for its quiet sophistication, came that week to visit me,", "x0": 0.11648351648351649, "y0": 0.26262626262626265, "x1": 0.8472527472527472, "y1": 0.2828282828282828}, {"text": "bringing a bunch of flowers. She admired the table.", "x0": 0.12087912087912088, "y0": 0.2828282828282828, "x1": 0.532967032967033, "y1": 0.29603729603729606}, {"text": "I said, \u2018Have a look underneath.\u2019", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.3185703185703186, "x1": 0.38351648351648354, "y1": 0.33022533022533024}, {"text": "She crawled under it, crouched there for a moment, then scrambled out and took her seat.", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.35353535353535354, "x1": 0.8384615384615385, "y1": 0.36596736596736595}, {"text": "\u2018Let\u2019s drink to your table,\u2019 she said.", "x0": 0.12307692307692308, "y0": 0.38927738927738925, "x1": 0.4076923076923077, "y1": 0.4024864024864025}, {"text": "\u201cDon\u2019t tease me. I\u2019ve been ripped off. I want revenge. I want a refund.\u201d", "x0": 0.12307692307692308, "y0": 0.42424242424242425, "x1": 0.6923076923076923, "y1": 0.43745143745143744}, {"text": "\u201cLook at it this way,\u201d she said. \u2018It\u2019s stable isn\u2019t it?\u201d", "x0": 0.12307692307692308, "y0": 0.45998445998445997, "x1": 0.5263736263736264, "y1": 0.4731934731934732}, {"text": "It was.", "x0": 0.12087912087912088, "y0": 0.49572649572649574, "x1": 0.17252747252747253, "y1": 0.5050505050505051}, {"text": "\u2018Is it the size you wanted?\u201d", "x0": 0.12307692307692308, "y0": 0.5306915306915307, "x1": 0.3373626373626374, "y1": 0.5439005439005439}, {"text": "Perfect size.", "x0": 0.12087912087912088, "y0": 0.5656565656565656, "x1": 0.21428571428571427, "y1": 0.5788655788655789}, {"text": "\u201cFits the room?\u2019", "x0": 0.12307692307692308, "y0": 0.6013986013986014, "x1": 0.24945054945054945, "y1": 0.6114996114996115}, {"text": "It did.", "x0": 0.12087912087912088, "y0": 0.6363636363636364, "x1": 0.16703296703296702, "y1": 0.6464646464646465}, {"text": "\u2018Think about it,\u2019 she said. \u2018It\u2019s an image. Of you. Of all of us. It stands steady. It doesn\u2019t", "x0": 0.12307692307692308, "y0": 0.6643356643356644, "x1": 0.832967032967033, "y1": 0.6884226884226884}, {"text": "wobble. Okay, it\u2019s got those nail holes all over the top. But they\u2019re marks of experience. And", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.6899766899766899, "x1": 0.8714285714285714, "y1": 0.7031857031857032}, {"text": "when you look underneath, you see it\u2019s been pulled together out of whatever was to hand.\u201d", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.7070707070707071, "x1": 0.8494505494505494, "y1": 0.7202797202797203}, {"text": "After a silence, I decided to take her analysis in the spirit in which it was meant. I", "x0": 0.12087912087912088, "y0": 0.7428127428127428, "x1": 0.8626373626373627, "y1": 0.756021756021756}, {"text": "arranged her flowers in a suitable vase, we leaned our elbows on the dark gleaming surface,", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.7606837606837606, "x1": 0.8582417582417582, "y1": 0.7738927738927739}, {"text": "and took up once more, at the point where we had left it last time, our endlessly interesting,", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.7777777777777778, "x1": 0.856043956043956, "y1": 0.790986790986791}, {"text": "fruitful and entertaining conversation.", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.7956487956487956, "x1": 0.42527472527472526, "y1": 0.8088578088578089}, {"text": "HELEN GARNER", "x0": 0.7252747252747253, "y0": 0.8321678321678322, "x1": 0.878021978021978, "y1": 0.8414918414918415}, {"text": "End of texts for Section I", "x0": 0.3934065934065934, "y0": 0.885003885003885, "x1": 0.6054945054945055, "y1": 0.8943278943278943}]]